* "German Quad", channel 3: V1A, GAIN 3 and the common tube Tc, V2A and the V2B follower, the CH3 tone stack and VOLUME 3. See preamp.net for the drawing and the assumptions.

V VRAIL x 100 400
R R86 x dp 4k7
C C87 dp 0 33u
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p

* V1A: 1M and 100p to ground, the 68k stopper (the input capacitor is bridged on the drawing), 1k2 with 10u on the cathode, 120k plate load.
R R1M in 0 1M
C C100P in 0 100p
R R68K in g1 68k
T V1A g1 p1 k1 12AX7
R R1K2 k1 0 1.2k
C C10U k1 0 10u
R R120A dp p1 120k

* CH3: 1n and 220k from V1A's plate into GAIN 3 (220k-A wiper pot), 220k at its wiper, which ST3 brings to the grid gt of the common tube Tc (1M to ground).
C C1N3 p1 q3 1n
R R220C q3 s3 220k
R VRG_T s3 w3 1
R VRG_B w3 0 1
R R220G w3 0 220k
R RST3 w3 gt 1

* Tc (channels 3 and 4): 1M at its grid, 120k plate, 680R with 1u, 4n7 into h with 1M to ground (the ST3 / ST4 contact to V2A).
R R1MG gt 0 1M
T Tc gt pt kt 12AX7
R R120T dp pt 120k
R R680T kt 0 680
C C1UT kt 0 1u
C C4N7T pt h 4.7n
R R1MH h 0 1M

* V2A (shared by the four channels: the relays ST1 and ST3 / ST4 bring the selected channel to h): 470k into the grid, 120k plate, 680R with 2u2; the V2B cathode follower
* (120k, the 10n + 100k load) and 220n into the stacks' input t0 with its 1M.
R R470H h gA 470k
T V2A gA p2 k2 12AX7
R R120B dp p2 120k
R R680A k2 0 680
C C2U2 k2 0 2.2u
T V2B p2 dp kf 12AX7
R R120C kf 0 120k
C C10NF kf c10 10n
R R100KF c10 0 100k
C C220N kf t0 220n
R R1MT t0 0 1M

* CH3 tone stack: R 10k from t0, then 560p and 39k to the treble pot (220k-B) and the node u; two 22n; BASS (1M-A) and MIDDLE (22k-A) rheostats; R 180k into VOLUME 3.
R R10K t0 t 10k
C C560P t tt 560p
R R39K t u 39k
C C22A u bt 22n
C C22B u mt 22n
R VRT_T tt wt 1
R VRT_B wt bt 1
R VRBS bt mt 1
R VRMD mt 0 1
R R180K wt v1 180k
R VRV_T v1 o3 1
R VRV_B o3 0 1
